 ckets cost $40. Openers seem to be Fantømex & snakesnakewhale\n\nAnberlin
  is a mid 2000s rock band with a mix of Emo/Alt Rock. Feel Good Drag - htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BJQNBxC6nUQ\n\nTickets: https://dice.fm/event
