DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T210000
SUMMARY:Disc Golf & Board Game Social @ Highland Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\n6:00 Disc Golf\, meet at pract
 ice goals by entrance to course (back parking lot).\n7:00 Board games + dr
 inks inside the main taproom.\n\n☀️Come for either activity or stay fo
 r both. We’ll have spare discs available if you want to try disc golf. I
 f you’d like your own\, Highland has some and Another Round nearby sells
  both used and new discs\, plus has practice goals.\n\nFor board games\, f
 eel free to bring your own favorites to share with the group. All skill le
 vels are welcome\, and folks are very friendly and welcoming.\n\nEnjoy the
  sunshine\, good weather\, food trucks\, and games. Often there is a live 
 band playing in the meadow\, a nice bonus for music lovers.\nHope to see y
 ou there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /315278546/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260616T005840Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260616T005840Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
