SUMMARY:Eliada Annual Fall Festival and Corn Maze
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nCorn maze fun can be found jus
 t five miles from downtown Asheville!\n\nEliada's Fall Festival & Corn Maz
 e offers corn cannons\, custom corn maze\, hay rides\, food trucks\, and p
 umpkins for sale. All proceeds benefit the children at Eliada Homes.\n\n##
 # Laura Blackley & Dave Desmelik\n\nThe singer-songwriter duo\, [Laura Bla
 ckley](https://www.laurablackley.com/) and [Dave Desmelik](https://davedes
 melikmusic.com/)\, will bring their unique mix of Appalachian blues\, soul
  and roots-driven Americana music to the maze.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /316615590/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260918T195025Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T195025Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
